 &#13;
 50g semi-salted butter &#13;


&#13;
 2 eggs &#13;


&#13;
 75g of flour &#13;


&#13;
 40g of sugar &#13;


&#13;
 1 teaspoon liquid vanilla extract &#13;


&#13;
 380g of semi-skimmed milk &#13;


&#13;
 3 baked apples with cinnamon &#13;
 
&#13;
 For apples: &#13;

 &#13;
 3 apples (I used pink lady apples, which bake well) &#13;


&#13;
 20g semi-salted butter &#13;


