 here is a fresh and light sorbet to finish the meal (or take a break). i had tasted a similar sorbet in bangkok at tea time at the « salon des auteurs » at l&rsquo;oriental (see the report  here ). it is offered before attacking the tray of cupcakes! my version is very lemony, with fresh ginger adding a little zing to the acidity of the lime. as a dessert with some shortbread, it will be perfect! 

