&nbsp; 

&nbsp; 
A delicious recipe for chocolate sorbet, so without milk or cream, which has a delicious taste of cooked chocolate. 
&nbsp; 

&nbsp; 
&nbsp; 
Recipe: 
&nbsp; 
 -600g of water  
 -220 of sugar  
 -220g of dark chocolate with 65% cocoa  
&nbsp; 
&nbsp; 
 Put water and sugar&nbsp;on low heat until boiling.  

 &nbsp;  
 Put the chocolate in a bowl and pour the boiling syrup over it.  
 &nbsp;  
 &nbsp;  

 &nbsp;  
 Mix well and return to the heat.  
 &nbsp;  





Boil again for 5 minutes. The liquid will thicken and take on a hot chocolate appearance.  



 &nbsp;  
 Let cool, then store in refrigerator for at least 3 hours. Place the liquid in an ice cream maker. Pour the sorbet into a tray and store in the freezer. When using, take the sorbet out 20 minutes beforehand for maximum smoothness!  
 &nbsp;  
 &nbsp;  

 &nbsp;  
 &nbsp;  





