&nbsp; 
Start by putting the butter, fleur de sel and sugar in a thick-bottomed saucepan. Add a dash of water (just enough to soak the sugar a little). 

&nbsp; 
Melt over moderate to high heat, stirring with a wooden spoon.&nbsp; 
&nbsp; 

&nbsp; 
